  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 2.19,
      "e": 3.1,
      "text": "- [Chance] An F-16"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.1,
      "e": 5.61,
      "text": "assigned to Spangdahlem Air Base, Germany,"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.61,
      "e": 9.41,
      "text": "crashed on October 8th after the pilot safely ejected."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.41,
      "e": 12.49,
      "text": "While the cause of the crash is still under investigation,"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.49,
      "e": 15.05,
      "text": "the base has shifted towards recovery efforts."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.05,
      "e": 18.54,
      "text": "- So we have over 100 volunteers here on-site"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.54,
      "e": 21.23,
      "text": "canvasing the entire area looking for any random part"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.23,
      "e": 22.09,
      "text": "that they can find."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.09,
      "e": 23.71,
      "text": "- [Chance] Local community representatives,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.71,
      "e": 26.19,
      "text": "along with the German Bundeswehr, are working together"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.19,
      "e": 28.19,
      "text": "to support the recovery process."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.19,
      "e": 31.28,
      "text": "- We have some, well, different procedures."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.28,
      "e": 33.93,
      "text": "And the Air Force has different procedures from ours."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.09,
      "e": 38.8,
      "text": "And we try to link them up, in some way."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.8,
      "e": 41.45,
      "text": "And that's what we have managed to do during this crash."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.45,
      "e": 43.98,
      "text": "- [Chance] The ironclad U.S.-German relationship"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.98,
      "e": 46.8,
      "text": "has enabled steady progress throughout the recovery."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.8,
      "e": 48.97,
      "text": "More information on the incident will be released"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.97,
      "e": 50.32,
      "text": "as it becomes available."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.22,
      "e": 54.76,
      "text": "Senior Airman Chance Nardone, Spangdahlem Air Base, Germany."
    }
  ],
